.TH _EXPORT_CHUNK 1 2024-Nov "" ".export_chunk"
.SH NAME
.export_chunk \- .export_chunk(wav, chunk.name, size = 364, lines = 512, smooth = 0, report = FALSE)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fI.export_chunk(wav, chunk.name, size = 364, lines = 512, smooth = 0, report = FALSE)\fR
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBwav\fB \fR\- . the wav reader object
.PP
.PP
\fBchunk.name\fB \fR\- . the name key of the image data section in the \fBdata_chunks\fR list
.PP
.PP
\fBsize\fB \fR\- 364. the pixel cells (the image rows) inside a single scan line
.PP
.PP
\fBlines\fB \fR\- 512. the number of the scan lines (the image columns)
.PP
.PP
\fBsmooth\fB \fR\- 0. the radius of the across scan line smoothing
.PP
.PP
\fBreport\fB \fR\- FALSE. print the empirical analysis report of the image section
.PP
.SH FILES
.PP
SMRUCC/R#.declare_function..export_chunk at chunks.R:line 39
.PP
